# ============================================================
# SpeakSmart — Environment Variables Template
# ============================================================
# HOW TO USE:
#   1. Copy this file and rename it to .env
#   2. Replace the placeholder values with your real API keys
#   3. NEVER commit .env to GitHub! It's in .gitignore ✅
#
# FOR VERCEL HOSTING:
#   Add these same variables in Vercel Dashboard:
#   Settings → Environment Variables
# ============================================================

# Google Gemini API Key
# Get free key at: https://aistudio.google.com
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# OpenRouter API Key (optional — free models available)
# Get free key at: https://openrouter.ai/keys
VITE_OPENROUTER_API_KEY=your_openrouter_api_key_here
